{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04958","headline":"奉和人日讌大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制 · 马怀素","name":"奉和人日讌大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日宇千门平旦开，天容万象列昭回。\n三阳候节金爲胜，百福迎祥玉作杯。\n就暖风光偏着柳，辞寒雪影半藏梅。\n何幸得参词赋职，自怜终乏马卿才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马怀素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}